      <h1>From an idea<br/><em>to TongaLang.</em></h1>
      <p>How a simple question during my final year at university led me into the world of programming language design, research and engineering.</p>
      <div class="page-hero-status" aria-hidden="true"><span>Zambia</span><span>Language design</span><span>Python · PLY</span></div>
    </header>

    <nav class="story-waypoints" aria-label="Milestones in this story">
